  "worked_solution": "Notice that we have a block diagonal matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}v & w & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 5\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}v & w & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}v & w \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{aligned}|\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =15.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
